# =============================================================================
# Fair-marketplace environment templates
#
# Actual env files live in the two workspaces — copy each template separately:
#
#   cp backend/.env.example  backend/.env
#   cp frontend/.env.example frontend/.env
#
# Then edit each file and fill in the secrets (JWT_SECRET, SESSION_SECRET,
# GEMINI_API_KEY, Cloudinary credentials, Google OAuth pair, VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN).
#
# Keep the backend PORT and the frontend VITE_API_URL in sync — both default
# to port 3002.
# =============================================================================
